<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SSx1" title="In Appendix E Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ MASA: Rethinking the Representational Bottleneck in LoRA with Multi-A Shared Adaptation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Expert Matrix Specialization Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SSx2" title="In Appendix E Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ MASA: Rethinking the Representational Bottleneck in LoRA with Multi-A Shared Adaptation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Cross-Model Adaptation Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
